  <text:tracked-changes text:track-changes="true">
   <text:changed-region text:id="ct1"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>A</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-04T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p text:style-name="P1">واصبروا</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region>
   <text:changed-region text:id="ct2"><text:insertion><office:change-info><dc:creator>A</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-04T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info></text:insertion></text:changed-region>
  </text:tracked-changes>
  <text:p text:style-name="P1">قال تعالى: ﴿<text:change text:change-id="ct1"/><text:change-start text:change-id="ct2"/>وَاسْتَعِينُوا<text:change-end text:change-id="ct2"/> بِال<text:span text:style-name="T1">صَّبْرِ</text:span> وَالصَّلَاةِ﴾ [البقرة: 45]</text:p>
  <text:p text:style-name="P1">الصبر<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>الصبر لغةً: الحبس.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> مفتاح الفرج،<text:tab/>والتطويل: الصبــــر.<text:line-break/>«سطر بعد فاصل»</text:p>
  <text:p text:style-name="P1"/>
  <text:p text:style-name="P1">فقرة بعد سطر فارغ.</text:p>
 </office:text></office:body></office:document>
